    "semantic_summary": "BaseVoiceModule serves as the core service layer orchestrating the entire Text-to-Speech (TTS) pipeline. It manages asynchronous data flow between a generation thread and a playback thread using internal queues. Responsibilities include hardware initialization via PyAudio, volume scaling, and ensuring complete audio buffer draining via the `collect_audio` method. It acts as a high-level coordinator, decoupling inference logic from physical audio output."
